    "title": "Programming Note: KTVZ Schedule Changes for New Year's Eve - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KTVZ - News Team ,\n1 days ago BEND, Ore. (KTVZ) -- On New Year’s Eve, several KTVZ newscasts will be preempted due to special programming. KTVZ News at 4:00 pm on FOX, KTVZ News at 5:00 pm, and KTVZ News at 7:00 pm will not air as scheduled and will be replaced by KTVZ News Special Reports. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
